            <ArticleTitle>[Clinical and experimental studies of the combined use of dibasol and furosemide].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>60-2</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A combined use of dibasol and furosemide was demonstrated to be followed by a decrease of furosemide toxic effect on the rat liver, an increase of its diuretic effect in patients and changes of furosemide metabolism kinetics in individuals.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
